=== Ceremony ===

The UAC Awards ceremony is held annually in [[Sant Cristòfor]]. The ceremony was held at a converted warehouse in the harbour-front district from 1983 to 1985, at the [[Auditori de Sant Cristòfor]] from 1986 to 1994, and at the [[Teatre Municipal de Sant Cristòfor]] from 1995 to the present. The ceremony is attended by UAC members, industry professionals, and invited guests, and it is broadcast on Balboan television.

